---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/SectionHeading.astro";
import Brand from "../components/Brand.astro";
import { config } from "../config";

const mail = `mailto:${config.supportEmail}?subject=Security`;
---
<Base
  title="Security & vulnerability reporting"
  crumb="Security"
  description="How to report a security problem with the olácompanion watch, our website or your olá account, and how long the watch receives security updates."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Security"
    title="Security & vulnerability reporting"
    lead="If you think you have found a security problem in the watch, our website or your olá account, please tell us. We welcome reports made in good faith and will look into every one."
  />

  <section class="container-x mt-6" aria-labelledby="report-title">
    <SectionHeading id="report-title" title="How to report a vulnerability" />
    <div class="glass mt-6 max-w-3xl p-6 text-muted">
      <p>
        Email <a class="link" href={mail}>{config.supportEmail}</a> with the subject “Security”. Please include:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
        <li>the product or page affected, and the version if you know it (for example the watch's firmware version);</li>
        <li>the steps needed to reproduce the problem;</li>
        <li>what you think the impact is, and anything else that helps us understand it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-4">
        While you investigate, please don't access, change or delete other people's data, and don't do anything that
        disrupts the service for others. Use only your own account and your own watch, and stop as soon as you have
        shown the problem exists.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        We aim to acknowledge your report within 5 working days and to keep you informed while we look into it and fix
        it. Please give us reasonable time to fix the problem before you share details publicly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-x mt-16" aria-labelledby="updates-title">
    <SectionHeading id="updates-title" title="Security updates for the watch" />
    <div class="glass mt-6 max-w-3xl p-6 text-muted">
      <p>
        <strong class="text-fg">We provide security updates for the <Brand name="watch" /> for at least two years from the date you buy it.</strong>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4">
        Updates are delivered to the watch over Wi-Fi, so keep it connected to receive them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-x mt-16" aria-labelledby="more-title">
    <SectionHeading id="more-title" title="More information" />
    <ul class="mt-6 grid max-w-3xl gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="glass p-5">
        <a class="link font-semibold" href="/trust/">Trust &amp; compliance</a>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">Which security measures are active today, and which are still in progress.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="glass p-5">
        <a class="link font-semibold" href="/legal/privacy/">Privacy notice</a>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted">What we collect, why, how long we keep it and your rights.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Base>
